{
  "id": 8860456714439,
  "title": "Personalized Just A Girl Who Loves Books Blanket - Custom Name Book",
  "handle": "personalized-just-a-girl-who-loves-books-blanket-custom-name-book",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we believe in celebrating passions! Delight the book lover in your life with this personalized blanket, designed for cozy reading sessions and showcasing their love for books. It's the perfect unique gift that combines comfort with a personal touch.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A thoughtful and personal gift that any book lover will cherish, perfect for showing off their love of reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to ensure the perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Ideal for book lovers on special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any book lover’s reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from Polyester for a lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Items</th>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
